WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Sojourner rolls down Pathfinder’s deployment ramp in a sequence of lander photographs.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
The same historical sequence repeats for easier viewing. It is not real-time video.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
July 1997. Images from the Pathfinder lander’s IMP camera. IMP Team / JPL / NASA.
